Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/BenJule/sddm-authelia-passkey
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sddm-authelia-passkey
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, sddm, libpam-modules, systemd
Recommends: sddm-theme-debian-breeze
Description: Passwordless SDDM login via Authelia OIDC Device Authorization + Passkey
 Lets a configured local user log into SDDM/Plasma by approving a
 device-authorization request on their phone (WebAuthn/Passkey user
 verification through Authelia), with the existing password login always
 kept as a fallback. Includes an optional KWallet auto-unlock component,
 off by default, using systemd-creds for at-rest secret protection.
 .
 Supported platform: Debian 13 (Trixie), SDDM 0.21.x, KDE Plasma 6,
 systemd 257+, Authelia 4.39+. Other platforms are unsupported/
 experimental - see /usr/share/doc/sddm-authelia-passkey/installation.md.
